orbit-tir 1
module fixture
function 0 take_items list
param 0 0 bag Bag
block 0 0
instr 0 0 0 load Bag bag
instr 0 0 1 member list<string> v0 items
instr 0 0 2 return unit v1
end-function 0
function 1 take_tags list
param 1 0 b Box
block 1 0
instr 1 0 0 load Box b
instr 1 0 1 member list v0 tags
instr 1 0 2 return unit v1
end-function 1
